{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51059","headline":"题灵石屋山 · 吕岩","name":"题灵石屋山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南坞数回泉石，西峯几叠烟云。\n登携孰以爲侣，颜寓李甲萧耘。\n（同前《宋诗纪事》。\n）（〖1〗《竹坡诗话》〖宋周紫芝撰〗：「西湖诸寺，所存无几，唯南山灵石，犹是旧屋。\n寺僧言，顷有数道人来丐食，拒而不与，乃题诗屋山而去。\n至今犹存，字画颇类李北海。\n好事者释之，乃是吕洞宾与三人来耳。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51059.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51059","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}